{"url": "https://x.com/TravisBoatman/status/2102827489286639972", "id": "2102827489286639972", "text": "Went to the LA @bot Design event hosted by @sunrao. Was a great event, even used some of their gifted credits to make a D&D style world builder design bot. \n\nhttps://x.ai/bot/N21yaS0hjGDUnqERh6UeX\n\nThen used the bot to make an active calendar in a D&D style tavern. Tasks as Quests. Patrons on whether people were home or not. All pulled from Chief of staff or assistant bots. Tavern music from Suno, and SFX from 11labs. Running locally hosted.", "raw_text": {"text": "Went to the LA @bot Design event hosted by @sunrao. Was a great event, even used some of their gifted credits to make a D&D style world builder design bot. \n\nhttps://t.co/7x6sKyIE6u\n\nThen used the bot to make an active calendar in a D&D style tavern. Tasks as Quests. Patrons on whether people were home or not. All pulled from Chief of staff or assistant bots. Tavern music from Suno, and SFX from 11labs. Running locally hosted.", "display_text_range": [0, 430], "facets": [{"type": "mention", "indices": [15, 19], "original": "bot", "id": "2085838061347217408"}, {"type": "mention", "indices": [43, 50], "original": "sunrao", "id": "94002419"}, {"type": "url", "indices": [158, 181], "original": "https://t.co/7x6sKyIE6u", "replacement": "https://x.ai/bot/N21yaS0hjGDUnqERh6UeX", "display": "x.ai/bot/N21yaS0hjG\u2026"}, {"type": "media", "indices": [287, 310], "id": "2102827050386284544", "display": "pic.x.com/6jRfbd6vin", "original": "https://t.co/6jRfbd6vin", "replacement": "https://x.com/TravisBoatman/status/2102827489286639972/photo/1"}, {"type": "media", "indices": [287, 310], "id": "2102827075090710528", "display": "pic.x.com/6jRfbd6vin", "original": "https://t.co/6jRfbd6vin", "replacement": "https://x.com/TravisBoatman/status/2102827489286639972/photo/1"}]}, "author": {"screen_name": "TravisBoatman", "url": "https://x.com/TravisBoatman", "id": "49826999", "followers": 3028, "following": 252, "lik